      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The present paper studies lipoprotein of human blood plasma in the norm and pathology. The three informational groups of lipoprotein crystals are isolated, which correspond to certain types of diseases. The question of possible diagnostics of some diseases by means of the lipoprotein crystals type in the polarized light is under discussion."},
